==Unlocking Fisherman==
The quest to unlock the fisherman job can be activated by the following:
*<Sports Club> Message Board in [[Sanctuary]]

==Trainers==
*Reed Stillwater in [[Stillwater Crossing]]

==Quests==
*'''Becoming a Better/Fisherman''': <Sports Club> Message Board in Sanctuary
*'''Testing the waters''': Reed Stillwater in Stillwater Crossing
*'''Itty Bitty Bait''': Jonah Relicreel in [[Rainbow Lake]]

==Collections/Junk==
*Briarwood Pond and Briarwood Stream Fish
*Snowhill Pond and Snowhill Stream Fish
*Wilds Pond and Wilds Stream Fish
*Extra Large Catch of the Day
*Extra Large and in Charge

==Tools==
Tools can be bought from the [[Coin Shop]], earned from quests, or even reeled in with a treasure chest!

*Simple Bamboo Fishing Rod - "This fishing rod allows you to cast a short distance." 
*Golden Reel Fishing Rod - "This fishing rod allows you to cast a short distance."
*Metal Fishing Rod - "This fishing rod allows you to cast a greater distance." 
*Red Scoped Fishing Rod - "This fishing rod allows you to cast a greater distance."
*Golden Scoped Fishing Rod - "This fishing rod allows you to fish in the deepest of waters!"

