==Lures==
Fishing lures are bought from the Coin Shop under the supplies item category:

* 16oz Steak - "This lure gives a 10% better chance of catching Winter Piranha, Toothy Tetra and Blind Swurglefish."
* Flyfisher 3000 - "This lure gives a 10% better chanceof catching Chilly Grouper, Butter, Flyfish and Briar Nibbler."
* French Fry- "This lure gives a 10% better chance of catching Blubbercuda, Baconfish and Changed Salmon."
* Frostflies - "This lure gives a 10% better chance of catching Frostgill Smelt, Flutterfish and Ink Cod."
* Mega Slider - "This lure gives a 10% better chance of catching Goofy Grouper, Finless Fish and Fanged Grouper."
* Nightcrawlers - "This lure gives a 10% better chance of catching Plattypus, Lady Tetra and Roach Loach."
* Perch Pinpointer - "this lure gives a 10% better chance of catching Pacu Pacu, Peachy Perch and Globfish."
* Shiny Crankbait - "This lure gives a 10% better chance of catching Coach Loach, Feral Catfish and Creeping Cod."
* Skipper Seeker - This lure gives a 10% better chance of catching Frozen Char, Slugmud Skipper and Old sole."
* Sleek Clicker - "This lure gives a 10% better chance of catching Talking Bass, Cheery Salmon and Bitter Betta."
* Thorn Jig - "This lure gives a 10% better chance of catching Blue Thornfin, Chipsen Fish and Thorny Trout."
* Tiny Rib - "This lure gives a 10% chanceof catching Spineless Stickleback,Calico Catfish and PurplenosedShark."
* Treasure Magnet - "This magnet gives a 10% better chance of catching Treasure."
